OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested in connection with
OL,4,Aairport waste dump
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a an
OL,7,Fillegal waste dump was found near an
OL,8,Fairport.
OL,10,FAn estimated 400 tonnes of commercial
OL,11,Fwaste was discovered at Callerton Hill
OL,12,Fnear Newcastle Airport in the summer,
OL,13,Falongside further dumps at the former
OL,14,FDewhirst Site in Peterlee and Hart
OL,15,FQuarry in Hartlepool.
OL,17,FA 29-year-old man has been arrested at
OL,18,Fa property near Preston, Lancashire, in
OL,19,Fconnection with the airport site, the
OL,20,FEnvironment Agency (EA) said. It
OL,21,Ffollows the arrest of a 32-year-old man
OL,22,Fin Sunderland over the other two sites.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
