OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested in connection with
OL,4,Aairport waste dump
OL,5,
OL,6,FGary Wallace, of the EA, said: "Illegal
OL,7,Fwaste sites are a blight on our
OL,8,Fcommunities and the environment, and
OL,9,Fwe're determined to bring those behind
OL,10,Fthem to justice."
